                       "description":  "The left panel displays all saved checks in a searchable, scrollable list. Users can browse existing checks to find one to edit, create new checks, and delete checks they no longer need. Each list item shows the check name, type badge (linter, formatter, type checker, test runner, security, build, custom), and tool information. The split-panel layout follows the library builder pattern used across all builder pages, with the list on the left and the editor on the right. Users select a check from the list to load it into the editor, or click the create button to start a new one.",
